.fill.justify.offset 5.rightmargin 70.pagesize 72.m1 3.m2 2.m3 2.m4 5.ec \.header /Finger/utilities/Finger.footer /Page #//Printed (%)/.in +5.define topic.bold.in -5$1 $2 $3 $4 $5.in +5.en.define endtopic.en.define noform.nojustify.nofill.en.define noformend.justify.fill.en.! Manual created with MWB.! END-OF-MACRO.topic NAMEFinger - Report gecos info on user.endtopic.topic SYNOPSIS.noformFinger <userid>.noformend.endtopic.topic DESCRIPTION	Finger reports the information in the gecos field of a specifieduser's password entry.  This information includes the user's full name,telephone number and such.  It also reports the user's home directoryand login shell. 	If the user places a file named .project in his home directory,the first line of this file will be reported in the Project: field ofthe finger information. Likewise, if the user places a file name .planin his home directory, the entire contents of this file will bedisplayed as the Plan: field of the finger report. .endtopic.topic CAVEATSThe .plan and .project files must be made publicly readable if they areto be useful to anybody but the user. .endtopic.topic FILES.noform\$HOME/.project		- The project file\$HOME/.plan		- The plan file/dd/sys/password	- contains gecos info for users.noformend.endtopic.topic ENVIROMENT.noform\$HOME 	- defines the user's home directory.noformend.endtopic.topic EXAMPLES.noform$ finger rootUserid: root                           In real life: System OperatorAffiliation: OS9 Gurus                       Office: 555-5978Exec dir: /h0/CMDS                             Home: (800) OS9-COOLDirectory: /h0                                Shell: /dd/cmds/sh Project: OS9 software constructionNo plan..noformend.endtopic.topic SEE ALSO.noformPassword.noformend.endtopic